      "modifiers": [],
      "maxStacks": 1,
      "exclusive": false,
      "enabledByDefault": false,
      "description_raw": "Increases ATK by 12%. Casting Intro Skill or Resonance Skill increases Heavy Attack DMG by 20% for 15s. Obtaining Shield allows Heavy Attack DMG to ignore 7.2% of the target's DEF for 7s, stacking up to 5 times. This effect is triggered once every 0.5s"
